*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0029
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-01-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 168
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0029.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY CRD0029C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
    05 DECLINE-RSN        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM PRIOR-BK-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    DISPLAY "DECLINE-RSN=" DECLINE-RSN
    STOP RUN.
PRIOR-BK-SCREEN.
    IF CU-BANKRUPTCY-FLAG = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN CU-BK-YEARS < 7
                MOVE 'D' TO CREDIT-DECN
                MOVE 'BK1' TO DECLINE-RSN
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 'R' TO CREDIT-DECN
                MOVE 'BK2' TO DECLINE-RSN
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'NA' TO DECLINE-RSN
    END-IF.
